{"title":"Dune Raider","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 23 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (1.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>52</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>102</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>63</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>52</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>23</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>102</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>63</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Antlion%20Hive\">Antlion Hive</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-raider?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-raider\" data-map-level=\"23\">Show level 23 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/00df2ba2db841f203145.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/18345f56833866432efe.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Acid)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/35f5d92a8be10abecd0e.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-